theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("2_58xxk")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 14
text = "Prototype Update Notes

- core abilities (dash, djump, air attack) unlocked in class advancement center
- added tower map button to HUD in HUB
- bag expanded to have tabs for each category (they unveil while you unlock facilities)

- Challenge Hunt Intro Shortened to 4 seconds
- Player now receives '1' ability point when leveling up (can be spent on abilities unlock)
- Class advance Center now opens to new \"Ability Tecch Tree\" where players can unlock core abilities before choosing a class

- class unlock moved to level 8
- Tech Nodes price adjustment influenced by inventory update
- Sword Upgrades recipe quantities increased
- Crafting Item Tab Tech Node Created.
- ** HOVER OVER ABILITY ICON ON PLAYER HUD TO READ HOW TO USE ABILITY"

